        "VOCAB|||Management Talk|||Enhance your vocabulary with these essential terms and natural expressions:\n\n*   **To delegate** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n*   **To align** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n*   **Micromanaging** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n*   **Bandwidth** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n*   **Bottleneck.** - Learn to use this in a complete sentence.\n\n> 🗣️ **Pronunciation Tip:** Keep your vowels clean and practice saying these terms slowly.|||Elo: 'I don't have the bandwidth for this right now' means 'I am too busy'.",
